) \\cup (B \\setminus A)","image_url":"","db_id":23},{"q_number":9,"display_qno":"9","unit_no":5,"sub_unit":"1.1","k_level":"K3","co_level":"CO3","marks":1,"question_text":"Demonstrate Multiple Inheritance and the Method Resolution Order (MRO) using the C3 Linearization algorithm in Python.","answer_key":"","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":27},{"q_number":10,"display_qno":"10","unit_no":5,"sub_unit":"1.1","k_level":"K4","co_level":"CO4","marks":1,"question_text":"Implement Operator Overloading in Python for complex numbers $z = a + bi$ by overloading `__add__`, `__sub__`, and `__mul__` special magic methods.","answer_key":"","has_formula":1,"formula_latex":"z_1 \\cdot z_2 = (a_1 a_2 - b_1 b_2) + (a_1 b_2 + a_2 b_1)i","image_url":"","db_id":29},{"q_number":11,"display_qno":"11","unit_no":1,"sub_unit":"1.1","k_level":"K3","co_level":"CO3","marks":1,"question_text":"Illustrate the memory model and variable referencing mechanism in Python with a memory allocation block diagram.","answer_key":"","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":4},{"q_number":12,"display_qno":"12","unit_no":1,"sub_unit":"1.1","k_level":"K4","co_level":"CO4","marks":1,"question_text":"Analyze the execution flow of the ternary conditional statement and chained comparison operators: $10 \\le x < 50$. Compare with traditional if-else blocks in terms of bytecode complexity.","answer_key":"","has_formula":1,"formula_latex":"10 \\le x < 50","image_url":"","db_id":5},{"q_number":13,"display_qno":"13","unit_no":2,"sub_unit":"1.1","k_level":"K4","co_level":"CO4","marks":1,"question_text":"Construct nested loop algorithms to print Pascal''s triangle and evaluate binomial coefficients given by $\\binom{n}{k} = \\frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!}$.","answer_key":"","has_formula":1,"formula_latex":"\\binom{n}{k} = \\frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!}","image_url":"","db_id":10},{"q_number":14,"display_qno":"14","unit_no":2,"sub_unit":"1.1","k_level":"K6","co_level":"CO5","marks":1,"question_text":"C