"2.3","k_level":"K1","co_level":"CO1","marks":1,"question_text":"Quelle est la monnaie officielle utilisée en France ?","answer_key":"L''Euro (€)","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":143},{"q_number":5,"display_qno":"5","unit_no":3,"sub_unit":"3.1","k_level":"K1","co_level":"CO1","marks":1,"question_text":"L''auteur du célèbre roman ''Les Misérables'' est :\n(a) Victor Hugo\n(b) Gustave Flaubert\n(c) Albert Camus\n(d) Marcel Proust","answer_key":"(a) Victor Hugo","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":135},{"q_number":6,"display_qno":"6","unit_no":3,"sub_unit":"3.4","k_level":"K2","co_level":"CO2","marks":1,"question_text":"Complétez avec le pronom relatif : ''C''est une ville ___ j''adore l''histoire.''","answer_key":"dont","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":146},{"q_number":7,"display_qno":"7","unit_no":4,"sub_unit":"4.1","k_level":"K1","co_level":"CO1","marks":1,"question_text":"Le TGV en France signifie :\n(a) Train à Grande Vitesse\n(b) Transport Général de Voyage\n(c) Tourisme Grand Voyageur\n(d) Train Global de Voyage","answer_key":"(a) Train à Grande Vitesse","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":137},{"q_number":8,"display_qno":"8","unit_no":4,"sub_unit":"4.2","k_level":"K2","co_level":"CO2","marks":1,"question_text":"Transformez à la voix passive : ''Le professeur explique la leçon.''\n(a) La leçon est expliquée par le professeur.\n(b) La leçon a été expliqué.\n(c) Le professeur a expliqué la leçon.\n(d) La leçon était expliquer.","answer_key":"(a) La leçon est expliquée par le professeur.","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":138},{"q_number":9,"display_qno":"9","unit_no":5,"sub_unit":"5.1","k_level":"K1","co_level":"CO1","marks":1,"question_text":"Quel musée abrite la célèbre peinture ''La Joconde'' ?\n(a) Le Musée du Louvre\n(b) Le Musée d''Orsay\n(c) Le Centre Pompidou\n(d) Le Musée Rodin","answer_key":"(a) Le Musée du Louvre","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":139},{"q_number":10,"display_qno":"10","unit_no":5,"sub_unit":"5.3","k_level":"K1","co_level":"CO1","marks":1,"question_text":"Que célèbre-t-on le jour de la fête de la musique en France ?","answer_key":"Le 21 juin (célébration de la musique vivante et solstices d''été).","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":149},{"q_number":11,"display_qno":"11","unit_no":1,"sub_unit":"1.2","k_level":"K2","co_level":"CO2","marks":1,"question_text":"Trouvez le synonyme du mot ''magnifique'' :\n(a) Splendide\n(b) Laid\n(c) Petit\n(d) Sombre","answer_key":"(a) Splendide","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":132},{"q_number":12,"display_qno":"12","unit_no":1,"sub_unit":"1.3","k_level":"K1","co_level":"CO1","marks":1,"question_text":"Donnez le féminin de l''adjectif ''nouveau''.","answer_key":"nouvelle","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":141},{"q_number":13,"display_qno":"13","unit_no":2,"sub_unit":"2.2","k_level":"K2","co_level":"CO2","marks":1,"question_text":"Complétez avec le pronom convenable : ''Je pense souvent à mes vacances. Je ___ pense souvent.''\n(a) y\n(b) en\n(c) les\n(d) leur","answer_key":"(a) y","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":134},{"q_number":14,"display_qno":"14","unit_no":2,"sub_unit":"2.4","k_level":"K2","co_level":"CO2","marks":1,"question_text":"Mettez au pluriel : ''un travail intéressant''.","answer_key":"des travaux intéressants","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":144},{"q_number":15,"display_qno":"15","unit_no":3,"sub_unit":"3.2","k_level":"K2","co_level":"CO2","marks":1,"question_text":"Mettez le verbe au subjonctif présent : ''Il faut que vous (faire) ___ attention.''\n(a) fassiez\n(b) faites\n(c) faisiez\n(d) ferez","answer_key":"(a) fassiez","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":136},{"q_number":16,"display_qno":"16","unit_no":3,"sub_unit":"3.3","k_level":"K1","co_level":"CO1","marks":1,"question_text":"Quel est le participe passé du verbe ''découvrir'' ?","answer_key":"découvert","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":145},{"q_number":17,"display_qno":"17","unit_no":4,"sub_unit":"4.4","k_level":"K2","co_level":"CO2","marks":1,"question_text":"Mettez la phrase à la forme négative : ''Il a déjà fini ses devoirs.''","answer_key":"Il n''a pas encore fini ses devoirs.","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":148},{"q_number":18,"display_qno":"18","unit_no":4,"sub_unit":"4.3","k_level":"K1","co_level":"CO1","marks":1,"question_text":"Nommez deux fromages français traditionnels renommés.","answer_key":"Le Camembert, le Roquefort (ou le Brie).","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":147},{"q_number":19,"display_qno":"19","unit_no":5,"sub_unit":"5.2","k_level":"K2","co_level":"CO2","marks":1,"question_text":"Identifiez le temps de la phrase : ''Si j’avais eu le temps, je serais venu.''\n(a) Conditionnel passé\n(b) Plus-que-parfait\n(c) Futur antérieur\n(d) Imparfait","answer_key":"(a) Conditionnel passé","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":140},{"q_number":20,"display_qno":"20","unit_no":5,"sub_unit":"5.4","k_level":"K2","co_level":"CO2","marks":1,"question_text":"Remplacez le mot souligné par le pronom convenable : ''Elle parle de son projet à son père.''","answer_key":"Elle lui en parle.","has_formula":0,"formula_latex":"","image_url":"","db_id":150}]},{"section_name":"SECTION – B","instruction":"Répondez à TOUTES les questions (Type Soit/Ou: Q.21 à Q.25) (5 x 5 = 25 Points)","choice_formula":"5 x 5 = 25 Points","total_marks":25,"questions":[{"q_number":21,"display_qno":"21. a","unit_no":1,"sub_unit":"1.5","k_level":"K3","co_level":"CO3","marks":5,"question_text":"Rédigez un court dialogue (8-10 lignes) entre un touriste et un réceptionniste d''hôtel à Paris demandant des informations sur les visites culturelles.","answer_key":"Dialogue avec formules de politesse, demandes d''horaires et conseils de visite.","image_url":"","db_id":151},{"is_or_divider":true,"display_qno":"( OR )","question_text":"( OR )"},{"q_number":21,"display_qno":"21. b","unit_no":1,"sub_unit":"1.5","k_level":"K4","co_level":"CO4","marks":5,"question_text":"Analysez l''impact de la Francophonie dans le monde moderne sur le plan éducatif, diplomatique et économique.","answer_key":"Organisation Internationale de la Francophonie (OIF), diversité culturelle et échanges internationaux.","image_url":"","db_id":156},{"q_number":22,"display_qno":"22. a","unit_no":2,"sub_unit":"2.5","k_level":"K3","co_level":"CO3","marks":5,"question_text":"Expliquez l''importance du système de transport public en France (SNCF, Métro, Vélib'') pour la transition écologique.","answer_key":"Mobilité durable, réduction des émissions de CO2 et accessibilité.","image_url":"","db_id":152},{"is_or_divider":true,"display_qno":"( OR )","question_text":"( OR )"},{"q_number":22,"display_qno":"22. b","unit_no":2,"sub_unit":"2.5","k_level":"K4","co_level":"CO4","marks":5,"question_text":"Traduisez le texte littéraire suivant du français vers l''anglais en respectant le style, le registre de langue et les figures de style.","answer_key":"Traduction fidèle du passage narratif avec grammaire et lexique appropriés.","image_url":"","db_id":157},{"q_number":23,"display_qno":"23. a","unit_no":3,"sub_unit":"3.5","k_level":"K3","co_level":"CO3","marks":5,"question_text":"Conjuguez les verbes entre parenthèses aux temps convenables (Passé Composé / Imparfait / Plus-que-Parfait) dans un paragraphe narratif.","answer_key":"Utilisation correcte de l''imparfait pour la description et du passé composé pour les actions soudaines.","image_url":"","db_id":153},{"is_or_divider":true,"display_qno":"( OR )","question_text":"( OR )"},{"q_number":23,"display_qno":"23. b","unit_no":3,"sub_unit":"3.5","k_level":"K4","co_level":"CO4","marks":5,"question_text":"Comparez le système universitaire en France (LMD - Licence, Master, Doctorat) avec le système éducatif en Inde.","answer_key":"Organisation des semestres, crédits ECTS, autonomie étudiante et frais d''inscription.","image_url":"","db_id":158},{"q_number":24,"display_qno":"24. a","unit_no":4,"sub_unit":"4.5","k_level":"K3","co_level":"CO3","marks":5,"question_text":"Présentez les particularités de la gastronomie française inscrite au patrimoine culturel immatériel de l''UNESCO.","answer_key":"Repas gastronomique, succession de plats, art de la table et convivialité.","image_url":"","db_id":154},{"is_or_divider":true,"display_qno":"( OR )","question_text":"( OR )"},{"q_number":24,"display_qno":"24. b","unit_no":4,"sub_unit":"4.5","k_level":"K5","co_level":"CO5","marks":5,"question_text":"(Question Obligatoire / Compulsory)\nL''intelligence artificielle transforme l''apprentissage des langues vivantes. Dans un essai argumenté (250-300 mots), évaluez les opportunités et les limites de l''IA pour la maîtrise de la langue française.","answer_key":"Arguments structurés : applications conversationnelles, correction instantanée vs manque d''immersion humaine et de nuances culturelles.","image_url":"","db_id":159},{"q_number":25,"display_qno":"25. a","unit_no":5,"sub_unit":"5.5","k_level":"K3","co_level":"CO3","marks":5,"question_text":"Écrivez une lettre formelle pour postuler à un stage professionnel dans une entreprise francophone.","answer_key":"Structure de la lettre officielle : coordonnées, objet, formule d''appel, corps, salutations respectueuses.","image_url":"","db_id":155},{"is_or_divider":true,"display_qno":"( OR )","question_text":"( OR )"},{"q_number":25,"display_qno":"25. b","unit_no":5,"sub_unit":"5.5","k_level":"K5","co_level":"CO5","marks":5,"question_text":"Rédigez un article de presse critique analysant l''évolution du cinéma français contemporain face aux plateformes de streaming mondiales.","answer_key":"Chronologie des médias, exception culturelle française et diversité cinématographique.","image_url":"","db_id":160}]},{"sect